    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Burn and Destroy for Stress Relief! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/e76bfc7781e7aaf6e5d922252a4926dc.poster.avif?t=1718977982\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/e76bfc7781e7aaf6e5d922252a4926dc.webm?t=1718977982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/e76bfc7781e7aaf6e5d922252a4926dc.mp4?t=1718977982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Don't overthink it\u2014just destroy all the walls in front of you and move forward! Break it all down from the foundation and watch it crumble!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Huge and Moving! Huge is romance! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/07ac2016c01332bcbf28dd69f6232ca6.avif?t=1718977982\" width=348 height=196 /></span><br><br>Gigantic fortresses resembling various creatures walk, break walls, and advance! Break wings, shatter legs, and destroy different parts!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Help Allies for Fever Time! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/3af3e63db1b9c6721212f0c0e1c40a4a.poster.avif?t=1718977982\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/3af3e63db1b9c6721212f0c0e1c40a4a.webm?t=1718977982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/3af3e63db1b9c6721212f0c0e1c40a4a.mp4?t=1718977982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Borrow the friendship power of the allies you've helped to easily break even the toughest iron walls!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Wagging Tails! Plump Bellies! Big Eyes! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/71045cebad606015cd2d14dae577e0c3.avif?t=1718977982\" width=384 height=384 /></span><br>For those who love emotionally expressive and cute animal characters,<br>Allies captured by Onbu are calling for your help!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System Minimum Requirements</h2>Minimum:<br>OS *: Windows 10<br>Processor: Core i5-10500<br>Memory: 8 GB RAM<br>Graphics: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Burn and Destroy for Stress Relief! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/e76bfc7781e7aaf6e5d922252a4926dc.poster.avif?t=1718977982\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/e76bfc7781e7aaf6e5d922252a4926dc.webm?t=1718977982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/e76bfc7781e7aaf6e5d922252a4926dc.mp4?t=1718977982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Don't overthink it\u2014just destroy all the walls in front of you and move forward! Break it all down from the foundation and watch it crumble!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Huge and Moving! Huge is romance! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/07ac2016c01332bcbf28dd69f6232ca6.avif?t=1718977982\" width=348 height=196 /></span><br><br>Gigantic fortresses resembling various creatures walk, break walls, and advance! Break wings, shatter legs, and destroy different parts!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Help Allies for Fever Time! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/3af3e63db1b9c6721212f0c0e1c40a4a.poster.avif?t=1718977982\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/3af3e63db1b9c6721212f0c0e1c40a4a.webm?t=1718977982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/3af3e63db1b9c6721212f0c0e1c40a4a.mp4?t=1718977982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Borrow the friendship power of the allies you've helped to easily break even the toughest iron walls!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Wagging Tails! Plump Bellies! Big Eyes! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856420/extras/71045cebad606015cd2d14dae577e0c3.avif?t=1718977982\" width=384 height=384 /></span><br>For those who love emotionally expressive and cute animal characters,<br>Allies captured by Onbu are calling for your help!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System Minimum Requirements</h2>Minimum:<br>OS *: Windows 10<br>Processor: Core i5-10500<br>Memory: 8 GB RAM<br>Graphics: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650",
